4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_n1P6mtqZ0Q7kNvwGARucI&_nc_oc=AdqxqXvCmWbdKvp57LaHnLVrbGgO65yMz-zHwNZSyet3B8BDVb-g-ibKC7HUTOjIgi8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLR2gw_pz-6dixeCLkO77yohs-ZvGal5qHxE9sYDiKv2w&oe=6AB27CD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zoSn_uMjxEUQ7kNvwFA0o6d&_nc_oc=Ado2AhDccWrNws3V50QDfAOI2H8lBXX8VDo3PzH-II41kZ0vVk6GLn95NUSqsRAw9-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjVqhhi1-4Z7kqLLmnhzEB0h0wwH4LKggVa0ztm3FE5A&oe=6AB281B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2lkclVvLGOIQ7kNvwH6Z6xi&_nc_oc=AdqNfGVNidnibCNx48xnS9HYR8QXIOOXrYExV1h3cPk67l_7C_fGuGjtqXi4Um15cjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6h1Is2MDq8ro5UF-73xOPexfswtYBLWN8aXTRwJ1d3w&oe=6AB28F55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p